\begin_layout Standard
Now using the property of the bose distribution 
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{equation}
\frac{1}{1+n_{B}\left(\nu\right)}=e^{-\beta\nu}\frac{1}{n_{B}\left(\nu\right)},
\end{equation}

