\frac{N_{l}}{N_{s}}\left(edt_{g}\right)^{2}\sum_{\boldsymbol{k}\boldsymbol{q}}\int_{-\infty}^{0}\frac{d\nu}{2\pi}\int\frac{d\epsilon_{2}}{2\pi}\frac{S\left(\bm{q},\nu\right)e^{-\beta\nu}}{-n_{B}\left(\nu\right)}A_{\text{Pd}}\left(\bm{k},\epsilon_{2}+\nu\right)A_{\text{Pd}}\left(\bm{k}+\bm{q},\epsilon_{2}\right)\left(n_{F}\left(\epsilon_{2}+\nu\right)-n_{F}\left(\epsilon_{2}\right)\right)\left(-\frac{\partial n_{B}}{\partial\nu}\right)\\
=\frac{N_{l}}{N_{s}}\left(edt_{g}\right)^{2}\sum_{\boldsymbol{k}\boldsymbol{q}}\int_{-\infty}^{0}\frac{d\nu}{2\pi}\int\frac{d\epsilon_{2}}{2\pi}\frac{S\left(\bm{q},\nu\right)}{1+n_{B}\left(\nu\right)}A_{\text{Pd}}\left(\bm{k},\epsilon_{2}+\nu\right)A_{\text{Pd}}\left(\bm{k}+\bm{q},\epsilon_{2}\right)\left(n_{F}\left(\epsilon_{2}+\nu\right)-n_{F}\left(\epsilon_{2}\right)\right)\left(\frac{\partial n_{B}}{\partial\nu}\right)
